  <hasOutcomeDescription rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">understand how culturally-specific social structures affect interpersonal communication, and determine how to apply this knowledge to their own interactions in a culturally sensitive manner.</hasOutcomeDescription>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

