  <hasOutcomeDescription rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">relate conceptual knowledge of population geography to real-world circumstances through creative collaboration and presentation.</hasOutcomeDescription>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

