  <hasContactTypeDescription rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">This includes podcasts for viewing as well as reading to be undertaken prior to attending a compulsory 1-hour seminar each week. At each weekly seminar students will contribute to interactive discussions based on designated reading. In addition to seminar discussions, students will attend compulsory 2-hour lab sessions that provide a comprehensive PC-based GIS exercise designed to develop and enhance their practical GIS skills. Completion of these compulsory seminars and labs is necessary to enable skills for completing written unit assessment. Independent learning is also required throughout the unit</hasContactTypeDescription>
