  <hasOutcomeDescription rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">demonstrate an ability to develop an advocacy plan that considers how climate change policy can be driven through public participation.</hasOutcomeDescription>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

