  <hasOutcomeDescription rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">recognise the ways in which popular culture in contemporary Asian societies is shaped by, reflects, and in turn shapes, broader social, cultural, political and economic processes in Asia.</hasOutcomeDescription>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

