  <hasOutcomeDescription rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">develop clear and scholarly interpretations from independent research and analysis, using the appropriate discourse conventions of written and oral forms, and be able to defend a critical position.</hasOutcomeDescription>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

