  <hasUnitCode rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">LAWS3213</hasUnitCode>
  <hasUnitTitle rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Preventing Contemporary Crime Problems</hasUnitTitle>
  <hasUnitLevel rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">3</hasUnitLevel>
  <hasUnitDescription rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">This unit will build on what students know about why crime occurs, what we currently do in response to crime, and what we could do differently. Using this knowledge, students will engage with contemporary crime problems in Australia, and be encouraged to develop innovative, theory- and evidence-based responses to address these issues.</hasUnitDescription>
