  <hasOutcomeDescription rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">gain an increased level of competency in all four macro skills—listening to, speaking, reading and writing German corresponding to proficiency Levels B1/B2 and upwards of the Common European Framework of Reference for Languages.</hasOutcomeDescription>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

