  <hasOutcomeDescription rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">understand the long-term, global and culturally diverse history of Australian society, and demonstrate familiarity with key themes and case studies from Australia's deep, global and diverse past.</hasOutcomeDescription>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

