  <hasOutcomeDescription rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">describe the key conceptual features of Indigenous knowledge systems and methods by which Indigenous theory is applied.</hasOutcomeDescription>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

