  <hasUnitCode rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">KORE1402</hasUnitCode>
  <hasUnitTitle rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Korean 2</hasUnitTitle>
  <hasUnitLevel rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1</hasUnitLevel>
  <hasUnitDescription rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">This is a continuing upper-beginner level unit following on from KORE1401 Korean 1 (or equivalent). It aims at further development of listening, speaking, reading and writing skills with increased vocabulary, language functions and a good basic grammar in everyday communicative situations. The unit develops intercultural communication skills as well as confidence in listening, speaking, reading and writing Korean. It provides a good basis for an intercultural understanding of Korean culture and society through situating the use of Korean language in relevant social and cultural contexts. The unit is useful for broadening students' international outlook, and for developing independent learning skills.</hasUnitDescription>
