  <hasUnitLevel rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">3</hasUnitLevel>
  <hasUnitDescription rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">This is the final unit in the sequence of the Music Theatre Performance Skills units as part of the Music Theatre Studies major and builds on MUSC3751 Music Theatre Performance Skills 3. The unit refines musicianship, technical skills, and repertoire in music theatre performance.
The emphasis is upon development of singing technique and performance skills (in singing, dancing, and acting) culminating in a performance of a mixed program of chosen repertoire.</hasUnitDescription>
