  <hasOutcomeDescription rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">demonstrate advanced knowledge about the nature of Africa's international politics and the functions of different African and non-African actors, institutions and policies.</hasOutcomeDescription>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

