  <hasOutcomeDescription rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">explain, and engage critically with, the conceptual frameworks, theories, techniques of investigation, and key debates associated with the global politics of the environment.</hasOutcomeDescription>
