  <hasUnitDescription rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">This unit builds on the progress made in SPAN2403 Spanish Studies 3 and aims to extend grammatical knowledge and communicative skills, both written and oral. It further develops the students' ability to communicate in Spanish by providing intensive practice in oral and written language, and enriches students' understanding of the culture of modern Spain. 
