  <hasOutcomeDescription rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">describe how structural, physiological and behavioural adaptations allow organisms to exploit a wide range of environmental conditions.</hasOutcomeDescription>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

