  <hasOutcomeDescription rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">demonstrate an understanding of  how agricultural technology and sensors can be used to improve farm productivity.</hasOutcomeDescription>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

