  <hasUnitDescription rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">This unit provides students with a solid understanding of mathematical functions and their applications. It also introduces students to the fundamentals of calculus and some basic statistics and probability.</hasUnitDescription>
