  <hasOutcomeDescription rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">describe how various signals from outside and inside the cell contribute to the regulation of the cell cycle and how defects in these pathways can lead to cancer.</hasOutcomeDescription>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

