  <hasUnitDescription rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">This unit builds on the foundation of core chemical principles and experimental techniques provided in first year units. More advanced concepts in physical and materials chemistry, the chemical industry, energy storage, and the environment, are presented. Chemical and thermodynamic concepts are taught in the context of contemporary real-world examples.
This unit will be offered from Semester 2 2024</hasUnitDescription>
