  <hasOutcomeDescription rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">demonstrate expertise in problem solving in parallel using distributed memory and distributed shared memory architectures, the two most common frameworks for high performance computing.</hasOutcomeDescription>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

