  <hasOutcomeDescription rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">develop skills in the collaborative analysis of environmental policies and plans and in the selection of the most appropriate policy tools to  address particular environmental issues.</hasOutcomeDescription>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

