  <hasOutcomeDescription rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">assess the role of vegetation on the water balance and how land-use change impacts upon hydrological pathways.</hasOutcomeDescription>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="#outcome2728">
