  <hasOutcomeDescription rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">develop a fundamental understanding of the principles underlying mechanics, heat and thermodynamics, waves and optics, electricity and the breakdown of classical Physics.</hasOutcomeDescription>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

