  <hasUnitDescription rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">This unit follows on from MATH1011 Multivariable Calculus and MATH1012 Mathematical Theory and Methods. It provides a foundation in some of the more advanced concepts and techniques of mathematics which are required in a number of disciplines, especially Physics.</hasUnitDescription>
