  <hasOutcomeDescription rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">identify and describe the key elements and institutions of the legal parameters of business as they apply to a hypothetical business entity.</hasOutcomeDescription>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

