  <hasOutcomeDescription rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">demonstrate a clear understanding of the Australian financial system with an emphasis on the role and functions of its regulators.</hasOutcomeDescription>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

