  <hasUnitLevel rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">3</hasUnitLevel>
  <hasUnitDescription rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">In this unit, you will learn about a new digital mindset, business models and strategies within a rapidly evolving digital context. By blending theory and practice, this unit will take a holistic view of digital marketing where topics will include content marketing, social media, SEO, PPC and email marketing (amongst others). You will also apply your knowledge by designing, optimising and delivering a marketing campaign in a simulated environment.</hasUnitDescription>
