  <hasOutcomeDescription rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">use commercial software and multi-disciplinary data to produce a digital representation of an asset across its lifecycle, from planning to design and construction.</hasOutcomeDescription>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

