  <hasOutcomeDescription rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">select appropriate tools for quantitative modelling in the solution of Environmental Engineering problems, drawing on existing understanding of system processes.</hasOutcomeDescription>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

