  <hasOutcomeDescription rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">develop a design work plan that addresses an engineering problem, and includes resources, a budget, consideration of appropriate legislation and standards for environment, health and safety.</hasOutcomeDescription>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

